    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Artifactory \u2013 A Chaotic Fantasy Lootbox Factory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/da703122689504b2b83575cc684f2f11.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=134 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Conveyor belts jam, machines break down, and lava (yes, actual lava) tends to get in the way. Work solo or with up to <strong>4 players in couch co-op</strong> as you race against time, chaos, and your own questionable teamwork skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/7aa53c3ab965486516467d5ed0259dca.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are free to decide what kind of items they want to create\u2014brew potions, forge weapons, or enchant magical gear. The range of possibilities depends entirely on how much they experiment with the available ingredients: the more creative the combinations, the higher the chance of crafting epic or even legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch what you grab from the conveyor belt\u2014if you're too slow, ingredients might disappear or end up in lava. And if the belt stops, so do you. Keep things moving and create something brilliant (or catastrophically wrong)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/bb34bf427565d331ff5865e28f13ad85.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack the Loot &amp; Get Paid!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load everything into lootboxes, seal them, and send them off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better loot means <strong>more gold and stars</strong>, unlocking <strong>new recipes, characters, and challenges</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a67318405b43024fe788be88a1f9f67.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=292 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Artifactory \u2013 A Chaotic Fantasy Lootbox Factory!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/44d3ab44dd486d0282d5e30d7ff26b3d.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/da703122689504b2b83575cc684f2f11.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=134 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most <i>questionably managed</i> lootbox factory! Your job? Fulfill magical item orders by crafting, forging, and enchanting loot\u2014without knowing exactly what customers want. Just follow the vague instructions (\u201cwe need <i>some</i> rare stuff!\u201d) and hope for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/318f82c14261616d4638615cdd3a453b.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Conveyor belts jam, machines break down, and lava (yes, actual lava) tends to get in the way. Work solo or with up to <strong>4 players in couch co-op</strong> as you race against time, chaos, and your own questionable teamwork skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/7aa53c3ab965486516467d5ed0259dca.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are free to decide what kind of items they want to create\u2014brew potions, forge weapons, or enchant magical gear. The range of possibilities depends entirely on how much they experiment with the available ingredients: the more creative the combinations, the higher the chance of crafting epic or even legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.poster.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.webm?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/1749d351ca2c5db578e4a72cd67c982b.mp4?t=1754484214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch what you grab from the conveyor belt\u2014if you're too slow, ingredients might disappear or end up in lava. And if the belt stops, so do you. Keep things moving and create something brilliant (or catastrophically wrong)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/bb34bf427565d331ff5865e28f13ad85.avif?t=1754484214\" width=627 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack the Loot &amp; Get Paid!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load everything into lootboxes, seal them, and send them off!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better loot means <strong>more gold and stars</strong>, unlocking <strong>new recipes, characters, and challenges</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 players</strong> for maximum mayhem.<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Experimentation:</strong> Discover <strong>new recipes and unexpected item combos</strong>.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unlockables Galore:</strong> Find new characters, blueprints, and more as you progress.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Fun:</strong> Every level throws new obstacles, disasters, and challenges your way.<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Moments:</strong> If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bonk your friend on the head with any item you pick up while trying to pack a lootbox, this is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep the <strong>world\u2019s most ridiculous factory</strong> running smoothly? (Spoiler: No. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a67318405b43024fe788be88a1f9f67.avif?t=1754484214\" width=616 height=292 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Artifactory is a chaotic and humorous couch co-op party game! Experiment with resources, discover new recipes, and fill lootboxes with wild creations. Play solo or with up to 4 players as you navigate hazards and fix machines in a magical fantasy factory!",
